Don't bother throwing the potions - in my experience half of them end
up going splat. Wield the potion, set the safe_pet option to false, and
smack him with it. Same effect, and a lot more reliable.

My big pet peeve is, you can't throw a potion, or hit with it,
downwards. Annoying if you're riding a pet and it gets injured - you
have to dismount, heal it, and mount again. Really, this does not make
sense - after all, it's right *there*, you should be able to hit it
well enough.

